# 05 · Protein structure

**EN** — Load crambin (PDB 1CRN), view it in 3-D (3Dmol.js), assign secondary structure with DSSP, and draw a 2-D Cα trace and a contact map.

**ID** — Memuat crambin (PDB 1CRN), menampilkannya dalam 3-D (3Dmol.js), menentukan struktur sekunder dengan DSSP, serta menggambar jejak Cα 2-D dan peta kontak.

*Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil*

#!csharp

#r "nuget: Gravicode.Biotech.Net.Notebooks, 0.2.0"
// Local build instead of NuGet (run `dotnet build Biotech.Net.slnx` first), comment the line above and use:
// #r "../src/Biotech.Net.Notebooks/bin/Debug/net10.0/Biotech.Net.Notebooks.dll"

#!csharp

using Biotech.Net.Core;
using Biotech.Net.StructuralBiology;
using Biotech.Net.Visualization;
using Biotech.Net.Notebooks;

BiotechFormatters.Register();

#!markdown

## Interactive 3-D view · Tampilan 3-D interaktif

Rotate with the mouse, scroll to zoom. 3Dmol.js is loaded from a pinned CDN version.
Putar dengan tetikus, gulir untuk memperbesar. 3Dmol.js dimuat dari CDN dengan versi tetap.

#!csharp

var crambin = SampleStructures.Crambin();
crambin

#!csharp

HTML(ProteinViewer.To3DHtml(crambin, new Viewer3DOptions { Coloring = ResidueColoring.SecondaryStructure, Style = MolecularStyle.Cartoon }))

#!markdown

## Secondary structure · Struktur sekunder

#!csharp

var dssp = Dssp.Assign(crambin);
dssp.ToSecondaryStructureString()

#!csharp

new CaTracePlot(crambin) { Coloring = ResidueColoring.SecondaryStructure, LabelEvery = 5 }

#!markdown

## Contacts · Kontak

#!csharp

ProteinViewer.ContactMap(crambin, cutoff: 8.0)

#!csharp

new ContactMapPlot(crambin) { ShowDistances = true }

#!markdown

## The chain as a protein · Rantai sebagai protein

#!csharp

new Protein("1CRN_A", crambin["A"].ToSequence(), "Crambin") { Organism = "Crambe hispanica", StructureId = "1CRN" }
